1
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:19,999
I give millions of thanks to Jesus and Mother Mary for raising me and my family to be witnesses of Mother Mary's apparition.

2
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:28,999
My name is Bindu, this is my husband Sethukumar, and our son Aravind, coming from Pathanapuram in Kollam district.

3
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,999
It was on August 25, 2022, that I first came here and took the Covenant.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,999
I took this Covenant specifically for the healing of my son Aravind.

5
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:49,999
From the age of one and a half, he used to get recurrent fevers, and in May 2022, he suffered from a persistent high temperature.

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,999
We took him to the hospital, did a full blood test, and found that his blood counts were critically low.

7
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,999
Because of his severe condition, the doctor referred him to Sree Chitra Hospital in Thiruvananthapuram.

8
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:13,999
After detailed examinations there, he was diagnosed with blood cancer and was admitted to RCC.

9
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:20,999
After one month of treatment, he suffered severe side effects from the chemotherapy.

10
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,999
He developed an infection in his pancreas, couldn't be given any food, and his entire body,

11
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:38,999
He was in a state where he couldn't even stand up, and since we are Hindus, we had offered many prayers at temples.

12
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:44,999
When my son's condition deteriorated like this, I fell into despair and stopped calling upon any gods.

13
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:57,999
During that time, an older sister I know, who runs a beauty parlor in Kavanad, Kollam, sent me some Kreupasanam testimonies through Whatsapp.

14
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:03,999
Even though she sent them, I did not open or watch those testimonies even once.

15
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:09,999
While my son was in this critical condition, my hand accidentally touched the screen, and the link somehow opened.

16
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:18,999
The very first thing I heard was a testimony of healing from cancer, and from then on, I started listening to the testimonies regularly.

17
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,999
Within two or three days of listening, I began to see gradual changes in my son, as he slowly started to sit up by himself.

18
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:33,999
He slowly started holding my hand and walking, and soon after, we were discharged from the hospital.

19
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:42,999
We had rented a house near the hospital, and we returned there to continue our stay.

20
00:02:43,000 --> 00:02:53,999
After that, I came to Kreupasanam, took the Covenant, and began regularly giving my son the blessed salt and honey.

21
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:59,999
I also used the Covenant oil to make the sign of the cross and prayed for him twice a day.

22
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:08,999
Because of the blood cancer, he had severe pain all over his body as the disease had spread to his bone marrow.

23
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:13,999
I faithfully applied Mother Mary's Covenant oil on all the painful areas of his body.

24
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:22,999
As a result of continuous use, the oil quickly ran out, and only a tiny drop remained at the bottom of the bottle.

25
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:29,999
Even after three months, I was in no situation to come back here and renew my Covenant.

26
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:35,999
Every day when we prayed and made the sign of the cross, my heart was heavy with sorrow over this.

27
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:40,999
I knew we could only get more oil if we were able to travel back here and renew the Covenant.

28
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:53,999
On the morning of December 7, 2022, my son had chemotherapy, so we anointed him with the remaining oil, prayed, and went to the hospital.

29
00:03:54,000 --> 00:04:00,999
When we returned from the hospital and took the bottle for evening prayer, we were completely astonished.

30
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:08,999
The bottle was miraculously overflowing with oil, and we knew instantly it was a profound blessing from Mother Mary.

31
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:17,999
Later, when my son was admitted to the hospital, his finger accidentally scratched behind his ear, causing a wound.

32
00:04:18,000 --> 00:04:22,999
Despite applying the medicines prescribed by the doctor, the wound was not healing at all.

33
00:04:23,000 --> 00:04:27,999
We used the doctor's ointment for about two months, but the wound started festering and getting worse.

34
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:36,999
When we consulted the doctor, he warned us that if the infection spread to the brain, nothing could be done to save him.

35
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:46,999
That is when I remembered the Covenant oil, and while my son was sleeping, I applied it directly to the wound.

36
00:04:47,000 --> 00:04:52,999
I prayed fervently for three consecutive days, reciting the Apparition Prayer of this holy place and the Apostles' Creed.

37
00:04:53,000 --> 00:05:01,999
I prayed with deep faith, and by the fourth day, I saw that the wound was completely healed.

38
00:05:02,000 --> 00:05:09,999
Later on, we brought my son here so the priest could lay hands and pray over him.

39
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:17,999
The priest prayed over him, and after that, he completely stopped experiencing vomiting and other harsh side effects of chemotherapy.

40
00:05:18,000 --> 00:05:23,999
He faced no further difficulties and started recovering very rapidly by God's grace.

41
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:31,999
After nine months, we returned to our home in Pathanapuram and traveled back only for his monthly check-ups.

42
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:45,999
He still had ongoing chemotherapy sessions, but in November 2024, he unfortunately got a fever again.

43
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:51,999
He was admitted to RCC, and at the time of discharge, a few doctors reviewed his case and told us he needed more treatments.

44
00:05:52,000 --> 00:06:00,999
They said he needed two more chemotherapy sessions, one in December and one in January.

45
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:08,999
We were asked to come back to the hospital on December 15th, and we returned home feeling anxious.

46
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:14,999
On December 13th, during the afternoon, my son was lying in the hall watching TV.

47
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:22,999
I suddenly felt a strong spiritual presence and turned around towards our bedroom where we keep a statue of Mother Mary.

48
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:30,999
I clearly saw the exact same Mother Mary that is enshrined here walking directly towards my child.

49
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:39,999
I witnessed it for just a second, and I immediately told my husband that Mother Mary had come to heal our son.

50
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:48,999
Two days later, we went to the hospital, and after running all the blood tests, the doctor gave us amazing news.

51
00:06:49,000 --> 00:06:56,999
The doctor told us we could stop all the medicines, and when I asked about the remaining two chemo sessions, he said they were no longer needed.

52
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:02,999
He confirmed that no further medication was required, which we recognized as a big blessing from Mother Mary.

53
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:11,999
I had been praying constantly, asking for a sign to confirm that it was truly by the grace of Jesus and Mother Mary that my child was healed.

54
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:18,999
So I firmly believe that Mother Mary Herself came down to heal him.

55
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:32,999
Later, on May 5th, 2024, I was deeply immersed in praying the Holy Rosary.

56
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:39,999
While I was fervently reciting the Sorrowful Mysteries of Jesus, a small piece of the green candle was still burning.

57
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:45,999
After finishing the prayer, I felt inspired to let it burn for a little while longer.

58
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:50,999
Within that flame, I clearly witnessed the divine presence of Jesus Christ.

59
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:56,999
When I came here and shared this experience, the Sister confirmed that Jesus Himself had come to heal my child.

60
00:07:57,000 --> 00:08:03,999
Then I became absolutely certain that my child was healed entirely by the mighty grace of Jesus and Mother Mary.

61
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:08,999
To this day, my son takes no medication whatsoever, and is completely healed.

62
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:16,999
The blood results are all completely normal. As a part of my apostolic work, I buy the newsletters from here,

63
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:23,999
and distribute it to everyone, and we help others in whatever way we can. Sometimes, I even travel,

64
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:30,999
all the way to Tenkasi, buy the Tamil newspaper, and distribute it there, which I have been doing for the past three or four months.

65
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:39,999
Every single day, I make sure to share the testimonies from here with at least someone. Seeing my unwavering faith in the Covenant,

66
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:46,999
and witnessing the abundant blessings I have received, I have directed many people here, and many have asked me and come directly.

67
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:55,999
I have personally brought so many people here, using my own money, without taking a single penny from them.

68
00:08:56,000 --> 00:09:01,999
I put them on a bus, bring them here, and help them take the Covenant.

69
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:09,999
Furthermore, I buy the blessed locket, honey, and salt from here and give them to others.

70
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:17,999
I offer crores of thanks to Mother Mary and Jesus for showering me with all these immense blessings. Moving forward, until the very day I die,

71
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:26,999
I will live deeply rooted in the Covenant. I listen to the Daily Bread without fail, I read the Bible, and,

72
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:34,999
I participate in all the prayers here without missing a single day, praying the Holy Rosary fervently. I listen to all the testimonies faithfully,

73
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:44,999
and I make sure to share them with everyone, because I first came to know about Mother Mary here through these powerful testimonies.

74
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:50,999
Therefore, to make the unknown aware and to deepen the faith of those who already know,

75
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,999
I will continue this mission, until my last breath. Crores of thanks to the Lord and Jesus.

76
00:09:55,000 --> 00:10:04,999
"He heals the brokenhearted, and binds up their wounds." Psalm 147:3.

77
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:12,999
Through the Covenant, when we completely surrender our deep sorrows and brokenness into the loving hands of Jesus and Mother Mary,

78
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:21,999
we receive a profound divine experience that completely heals our shattered hearts. God is the one who intimately knows our deepest pain,

79
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:30,999
and He intervenes in every single aspect of our lives. That God who binds our wounds, that God who sees our hidden tears,

80
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:37,999
invites us into a deep bond of faith, which is the Covenant. It is through this Covenant that we embark on our journey of faith.

81
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:46,999
It is a beautiful spiritual journey. As this sister Bindu just shared with us, when she first heard the devastating news that her son had blood cancer,

82
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:54,999
she frantically went to all possible places, prayed, and called upon many deities. Later, she fell into a state of utter despair,

83
00:10:55,000 --> 00:11:01,999
completely giving up on prayer and firmly believing that she would never call upon anyone for help again.

84
00:11:02,000 --> 00:11:09,999
It was during this dark period of her life that a friend sent her a link to the Kreupasanam YouTube channel. Even then,

85
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:18,999
she had absolutely no interest and never even bothered to open it. But one day, entirely by accident, her hand brushed the screen,

86
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:27,999
and the Kreupasanam YouTube channel opened up. As we know, our official channel features Father V.P. Joseph Kreupasanam; the very moment it opened,

87
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:35,999
the first video that played was a powerful testimony of a miraculous cancer healing. This dear daughter listened to it,

88
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:43,999
and she testifies today that it was a mighty intervention from God. That YouTube video she never wanted to watch,

89
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:51,999
opened by an accidental touch, was truly the supernatural intervention of our Blessed Mother. Nothing happens here without Mother's knowledge; at Kreupasanam,

90
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:58,999
it is solely through Mother's divine intervention that she calls her chosen people here. She leads us through various,

91
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:05,999
mysterious ways that we cannot even comprehend. And so, this daughter listened to the YouTube video, heard the Kreupasanam testimonies,

92
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:14,999
and from the very second she began to intercede for her son, this boy afflicted with blood cancer started experiencing a miraculous healing.

93
00:12:15,000 --> 00:12:21,999
This mother witnessed a lot of improvement in his condition. When we strictly adhere to the conditions of the Covenant, with fervent zeal and total honesty,

94
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:27,999
and lead our lives moving forward, we will undoubtedly experience the glorious blessings of Jesus and His Blessed Mother in our own lives.

95
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:33,999
In the Covenant, through the powerful intercession of the Blessed Mother, we receive profound peace of mind,

96
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:41,999
the strength of the Holy Spirit, and a renewed hope in our lives. In our lives too, God is the ultimate physician of our hearts.

97
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:47,999
Let us surrender all our sicknesses at His feet and pray. Let us firmly believe that the Blessed Mother, the Kreupasanam Mother, is our Mother of Consolation,

98
00:12:48,000 --> 00:12:56,999
and the Kreupasanam Covenant is the true path that helps us experience this divine healing.

99
00:12:57,000 --> 00:13:05,999
For the massive blessing showered upon this family, especially this tremendous physical healing, it was not merely a vision of Mother Mary,

100
00:13:06,000 --> 00:13:12,999
but her very real presence; even in the candle, Mother revealed her comforting presence, assuring them, "My children, I am with you."

101
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:20,999
She revealed this in the green wick. Mother herself manifested, provided her divine presence in the green wick, and miraculously,

102
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:28,999
filled the bottle with anointing oil. We all know that it was on December 7th that the Blessed Mother appeared alive in our midst,

103
00:13:29,000 --> 00:13:37,999
specifically at 2:30 PM in the year 2004, right here in this shrine. Miraculously, in the lives of these children too, it was exactly on December 7th,

104
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:41,999
that Mother heard the agonizing prayer of this daughter and filled her bottle with anointing oil.

105
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:47,999
In our own lives, we have a Mother who fills every void and walks closely beside us. All our deeply held pains,

106
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:53,999
life's crises, and overwhelming problems, let us completely surrender them into the loving hands of that Mother, the Kreupasanam Mother.

107
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:57,999
Let us continue our Covenant life with even greater zeal and passion. As Psalm 30:2 says,

108
00:13:58,000 --> 00:14:06,999
"O Lord my God, I cried to you for help, and you restored my health." . Let us express our deepest gratitude to that Almighty God,

109
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:12,999
who heard the desperate cry of these children and granted them complete healing. For the immense blessing and profound physical healing received by Bindu and her family,

110
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:18,999
let us loudly clap our hands and give all glory to God! Thank you Jesus, Praise you Jesus, Ave Maria!

111
00:14:19,000 --> 00:14:30,999
Extraordinary experiences of God can now be yours. If you haven't subscribed to this YouTube channel yet, please subscribe right now.

112
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:35,000
Share this video with your friends right now, and become a missionary for the Lord.
